      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm planning a business trip through Japan next month. i need to get from Tokyo to Osaka and then up to Fukuoka. should i just stick to the Shinkansen for everything or is it worth looking into domestic flights for those legs? looking for the best balance of speed and reliability. thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
